\\"nggak/ngga\\\"*, *\\\"banget\\\"*, *\\\"udah\\\"*, *\\\"gitu\\\"*, *\\\"parah\\\"*, *\\\"bodo amat\\\"*, *\\\"sialan/anjir/brengsek\\\"*, *\\\"mager\\\"*, dll).\\n3. **Realisme Tetap Hidup (Tanpa Kaku):** Khusus genre militer/taktis (seperti Tom Clancy), atmosfer ketegangan operasi, prosedur CQB, dan nama senjata asli (MP5, flashbang, SOP, 9mm, perimeter, breach) tetap akurat, namu\n<truncated 8285 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"D:/JV/novel yoga/AGENTS.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
